s1_oldestSel_*_valid_r and s2_oldestSel_*_valid_r, without a reset, so they
stay x and no load issues. XiangShan reset both in OpenXiangShan/XiangShan#2831,
after the revision the suite imported. Do the same in the generated Verilog of
every configuration.

